@startuml
title RAG Node Creation Process

participant "RagNodeService" as Service
participant "HybridRagProcessor" as Hybrid
participant "Strategies" as Strategies
participant "RagNode" as RagNode

== 用户文件RAG节点创建 ==
Service -> Service : createUserFileRagNode()
Service -> Service : 检查 hybridRagProcessor
Service -> Hybrid : 如果存在，创建 RagNode(hybridRagProcessor)
Service -> Strategies : 如果不存在，使用传统策略
Service -> RagNode : 创建 RagNode(策略列表)

== 专业知识库RAG节点创建 ==
Service -> Service : createProfessionalKbRagNode()
Service -> Service : 检查 hybridRagProcessor
Service -> Hybrid : 如果存在，创建 RagNode(hybridRagProcessor)
Service -> Strategies : 如果不存在，使用专业库策略
Service -> RagNode : 创建 RagNode(策略列表)

@enduml
